<title>USA: MTBE slightly up on unleaded's strength.</title>
<headline>MTBE slightly up on unleaded's strength.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. spot MTBE prices gained ground late this week amid stronger unleaded gasoline values but the market still risked bearish moves due to imports, players said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trade, however, remained light with only a few deals slipping through. &quot;The market is not doing anything. It's pretty thin,&quot; said a New York Harbor trader.</p>
